  "description": "LISTED BUILDING CONSENT FOR LOCALISED STABILISATION\r\n(UNDERPINNING) WORKS TO THE SOUTHWEST CORNER OF THE MAIN PROPERTY FOLLOWING\r\nSUBSIDENCE RELATED DAMAGE. MITIGATION IN THE FORM OF DRAIN REPAIRS AND\r\nLOCALISED VEGETATION WORKS HAVE BEEN UNDERTAKEN AND WHILE THESE HAVE REDUCED\r\nTHE MOVEMENT ACTING, IT IS CONSIDERED STABILISATION WORKS WILL ALSO BE\r\nNECESSARY TO SAFEGUARD THE FUTURE OF THE PROPERTY. ONCE STABILISED,\r\nSUPERSTRUCTURE STRENGTHENING REPAIRS AND REDECORATION TO BE UNDERTAKEN",
